1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,250
Guess who breathes like this?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,650
Sniff, sniff, sniff!

3
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,451
Hmm. Is it a puppy?

4
00:00:09,451 --> 00:00:10,842
Is it a kitty?

5
00:00:11,592 --> 00:00:12,779
Here's a clue.

6
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:14,176
I have long ears,

7
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:15,642
and I love to hop!

8
00:00:17,442 --> 00:00:18,566
It's a bunny!

9
00:00:18,566 --> 00:00:20,321
It's the bunny breath!

10
00:00:22,971 --> 00:00:23,464
Yes!

11
00:00:23,464 --> 00:00:26,346
Bunnies sniff with their little noses.

12
00:00:26,696 --> 00:00:28,821
Let's do it together.

13
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:31,184
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

14
00:00:31,184 --> 00:00:33,146
Then one long breath out.

15
00:00:33,496 --> 00:00:34,796
Ahh.

16
00:00:36,396 --> 00:00:37,714
One more time.

17
00:00:37,714 --> 00:00:39,496
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

18
00:00:39,846 --> 00:00:41,146
Ahh.

19
00:00:42,746 --> 00:00:44,585
My body feels soft

20
00:00:44,585 --> 00:00:46,162
and sleepy now.

21
00:00:46,512 --> 00:00:48,520
Goodnight, Honey!

22
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:51,245
Goodnight, Lulu!

23
00:00:51,995 --> 00:00:53,802
Share with a friend and

24
00:00:53,802 --> 00:00:56,095
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

25
00:00:56,695 --> 00:00:58,333
Watch the full story

26
00:00:58,333 --> 00:00:59,970
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
